  "setup_notes": [
    "Press/finisher margins are not specified in the workbook. Existing provisional setup retained: 0.5 in lead; 0.25 in left, right and trail. Registration marks use these provisional press margins.",
    "The app retains 12x18 and 13x19 stock, short-edge feeding, a 3-column limit and a provisional 30-row search limit.",
    "Minimum finished size is interpreted as across-feed width x feed length. Paper weight, crease tooling widths/depth, sensing and speed are reference specifications, not automatic job checks.",
    "Variable-gutter travel limits/increments are not specified. Existing provisional 0.125-1 in range and 1 micrometre calculation increment retained.",
    "Workbook lists 40 in hand-fed as 104 cm, which is inconsistent. The inch specification is retained as reference; long hand-fed stock is not enabled in this app.",
    "Strike perf is an optional attachment; confirm it is installed before using strike-perf layouts. The user-defined maximum remains four tool positions.",
    "Stock thickness 0.15–0.4 mm: PT 9375BSC Operator Manual 2024.pdf, PDF page 4. Numeric crease-depth mapping remains an application convention, not physical calibration."
